### Book Recommendation, Screen-Time & Library Management System - API Collection
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1

### ==============================================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & USERS
### ==============================================================================

### Login as Reader
# @name loginReader
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reader@library.com",
  "password": "Reader123!"
}

### Store Token
@readerToken = {{loginReader.response.body.access}}

### Login as Admin / Librarian
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@library.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Store Admin Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access}}

### Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### ==============================================================================
### 2. BOOKS, MOODS & SEARCH
### ==============================================================================

### Get Catalog Books (Paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?page=1&page_size=10

### Get Single Book Detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/

### Get Similar Books (TF-IDF Cosine Similarity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/similar/

### Get 18 Mood Profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/moods/

### Multi-Filter Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/?q=space&mood=mysterious&available=true

### Autocomplete Suggestions
GET {{baseUrl}}/search/autocomplete/?q=odys

### ==============================================================================
### 3. HYBRID RECOMMENDATION ENGINE
### ==============================================================================

### Get My Personalized Recommendations (Hybrid)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/me/?limit=6
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Get Mood-Filtered Recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/mood/mysterious/?limit=6

### Admin Rec Debugger & Score Inspector
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/admin/debug/?book_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin Rebuild Recommendation Model Matrix
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/admin/rebuild/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ==============================================================================
### 4. LIBRARY CIRCULATION & LOANS
### ==============================================================================

### Borrow a Book (14 Days)
POST {{baseUrl}}/library/borrow/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book_id": 1,
  "notes": "Testing borrowing from API"
}

### Get My Active Loans
GET {{baseUrl}}/library/my-loans/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Toggle Favorite Book
POST {{baseUrl}}/library/favorites/toggle/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book_id": 1
}

### Toggle Wishlist
POST {{baseUrl}}/library/wishlist/toggle/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book_id": 2
}

### ==============================================================================
### 5. SCREEN-TIME & READING ANALYTICS
### ==============================================================================

### Start Live Reading Session
# @name startSession
POST {{baseUrl}}/analytics/reading-sessions/start/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book_id": 1,
  "source": "WEB"
}

### Store Session ID
@sessionId = {{startSession.response.body.id}}

### Session Heartbeat Pulse
POST {{baseUrl}}/analytics/reading-sessions/{{sessionId}}/heartbeat/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### End Reading Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/analytics/reading-sessions/{{sessionId}}/end/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pages_read": 12
}

### Get User Screen-Time & Streak Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/user/
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### Get Admin Platform-Wide Telemetry
GET {{baseUrl}}/analytics/admin/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
